      "mergedPostDetails": "I notice that on this build, physbones with stiffness jitter a lot when it didn't happen in live at all. This jitter seems to happen whenever an avatar that the local user is wearing has stiffness on a physbone and they move around at all. It almost looks like the bone wants to move in the direction you're moving to.\n\nThe odd thing is that it doesn't happen to everyone, but a certain number of people. None of my friends have this issue at all, but some people that I've had talked to and don't know personally have this issue.\n\nHere is an avatar that I've seen with this issue:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_441d5de0-fdd8-4593-ac75-f03edef1b8fa\n\nOn this avatar, take note of the ears and how they move.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1516] PhysBones with stiffness applied have really bad jitter when the player moves.",
